# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model Checkpoints (Git LFS Recommendation)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `weights/best_resnet50_wrist.pth` (~94.4 MB) approaches GitHub's 100 MB
# file size limit. Track `.pth` checkpoints with Git LFS instead of raw Git:
#
#   git lfs install
#   git lfs track "weights/*.pth"
#   git add .gitattributes weights/best_resnet50_wrist.pth
#
# If you prefer to host weights externally (e.g., Zenodo / Hugging Face Hub)
# and exclude them from the Git tree, uncomment the line below:
# weights/*.pth
